Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This video uses accepted Chromium screenshots, not live footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is synthetic; inference is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,TrustFlow asks: was the action authorized, and did it happen once?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Planner proposes. Deterministic policy decides risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans approve high-risk actions. Execution preserves operation identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Verification reads ledger evidence. Muse inference remains pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This synthetic five-thousand-dollar transfer pauses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The screen shows the plan version, payload and full hash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Approval authorizes that exact snapshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Accepted checks reject missing credentials, wrong hashes and replayed\Ndecisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The model cannot grant itself permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,After approval, one transaction commits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Independent SQLite observations match the authorized operation and conserved\Ntotal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A separate concurrent approval test produces one transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A rejected three-thousand-dollar request creates no transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Reload preserves rejection; late approval cannot revive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The ledger independently supports the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Controlled fault injection holds a real worker past timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,After that worker commits, reconciliation finds the original transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,An injected fake review failure leaves verification pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Verification-only retry completes without another transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the backend is killed after SQLite commit, before saving success.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Signal nine interrupts the process. The same container restarts into\Nverification pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Verification-only retry preserves the original transaction, approval hash\Nand snapshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This demonstrates a controlled checkpoint, not every storage failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Missing mandatory policy evidence fails closed before tools run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a local retrieval check, with no ledger mutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One command repeats six scenarios and publishes evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Accepted results are fake-mode checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Live Muse evaluation remains pending.
